# Line ends: LF in the repository whatever the checkout's platform (S-056). Shell scripts, Dockerfiles and the
# pinned models list must stay LF in the working tree too: bash refuses CRLF scripts, and web-models.sh hashes
# models.json into the web's base image tag.
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
models/models.json text eol=lf
